error[union-key]: union variant 'red_value' cannot use @key
    ┌ test.idl:10:6
    │
  8 │ union ColorData switch(Color) {
  9 │ case RED:
 10 │     @key long red_value;
    ·      ^^^ @key not allowed on union variant
 11 │ case GREEN:
 12 │     @key long green_value;
    └──
 help: remove @key from the variant or move it to the discriminator
 note: only the union discriminator can be marked as @key

error[union-key]: union variant 'green_value' cannot use @key
    ┌ test.idl:12:6
    │
 10 │     @key long red_value;
 11 │ case GREEN:
 12 │     @key long green_value;
    ·      ^^^ @key not allowed on union variant
 13 │ case BLUE:
